      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The comparison you're making is a heavy burden, but it's a distortion of reality, not a reflection of your worth. Your life has inherent value, regardless of who is missing or who is around you. If these feelings of being a mistake are persistent, please consider talking to a therapist who can help you unpack these complex feelings of grief and self-worth. You are not a mistake, and you deserve to feel grounded in your own life.",
      "source": "target",
